    "text": "{{requester_name}} requested to hire\n\nRole:       {{job_title}}\nDepartment: {{department}}\nOpenings:   {{openings}}\nBudget:     ₹{{budget_range}} per month\nReason:     {{reason}}\n\nReview requisition: {{requisition_url}}\n\nThanks,\n{{org_name}}\n\n--\nYou are receiving this because you have an account at {{org_name}}.\nQuestions? Write to {{support_email}}.\n{{org_name}} · {{org_address}}\n"
