    "html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<meta name=\"x-apple-disable-message-reformatting\">\n<meta name=\"color-scheme\" content=\"light\">\n<title>{{count}} leave requests still pending</title>\n</head>\n<body style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background:#F6F5F2;\">\n<!-- template: leave-escalation-ceo | subject: {{count}} leave requests still pending -->\n<div style=\"display:none;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;mso-hide:all;font-size:1px;line-height:1px;color:#F6F5F2;opacity:0;\">HR has not acted on these yet.&#8203;&nbsp;&#8203;&nbsp;&#8203;&nbsp;&#8203;&nbsp;&#8203;&nbsp;&#8203;&nbsp;</div>\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" bgcolor=\"#F6F5F2\" style=\"background:#F6F5F2;\">\n<tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:32px 16px;\">\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"600\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:600px;background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6E4DF;border-radius:8px;\">\n<tr><td style=\"padding:20px 32px;background:#201E1F;border-radius:8px 8px 0 0;\">\n<img src=\"{{logo_url}}\" width=\"120\" alt=\"{{org_name}}\" style=\"display:block;border:0;outline:none;height:auto;max-width:120px;\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"height:3px;line-height:3px;font-size:3px;background:#D4AF37;\">&nbsp;</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:32px;\">\n<h1 style=\"margin:0 0 16px 0;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:22px;line-height:30px;font-weight:bold;color:#201E1F;\">Leave requests still pending</h1>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 16px 0;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:24px;color:#201E1F;\">HR was reminded but these requests are still open. You can decide them directly.</p>\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"margin:8px 0 24px 0;border-top:1px solid #E6E4DF;\">\n<tr><td style=\"padding:10px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #E6E4DF;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:20px;color:#5C5859;width:40%;vertical-align:top;\">{{employee_1}}</td><td style=\"padding:10px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #E6E4DF;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:20px;color:#201E1F;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;\">{{dates_1}}</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:10px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #E6E4DF;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:20px;color:#5C5859;width:40%;vertical-align:top;\">…</td><td style=\"padding:10px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #E6E4DF;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:20px;color:#201E1F;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;\">…</td></tr>\n</table>\n<table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"margin:8px 0 24px 0;\">\n<tr><td align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"#D4AF37\" style=\"border-radius:6px;\">\n<a href=\"{{app_url}}/hr/leaves?tab=approvals\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:12px 24px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:20px;font-weight:bold;color:#201E1F;text-decoration:none;border-radius:6px;\">Open approvals</a>\n</td></tr></table>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 16px 0;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;color:#5C5859;\">If the button does not work, copy this link into your browser:<br><span style=\"color:#201E1F;word-break:break-all;\">{{app_url}}/hr/leaves?tab=approvals</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 16px 0;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:24px;color:#201E1F;\">Thanks,<br>{{org_name}}</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:20px 32px;border-top:1px solid #E6E4DF;background:#FAFAF8;border-radius:0 0 8px 8px;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;color:#5C5859;\">You are receiving this because you have an account at {{org_name}}. Questions? Write to <a href=\"mailto:{{support_email}}\" style=\"color:#201E1F;\">{{support_email}}</a>.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:8px 0 0 0;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;color:#5C5859;\">{{org_name}} &middot; {{org_address}}</p>\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n</body>\n</html>\n",
