    "text": "{{author_name}} commented on {{ticket_key}}\n\n“{{comment_snippet}}”\n\nReply in ticket: {{app_url}}/projects/{{project_id}}/tickets/{{ticket_key}}#comment-{{comment_id}}\n\nThanks,\n{{org_name}}\n\n--\nYou are receiving this because you have an account at {{org_name}}.\nQuestions? Write to {{support_email}}.\n{{org_name}} · {{org_address}}\n"
